WEBVTT

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.260
Hiyori-chan...

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:15.610
The person before you is both
Juujou Hiyori and Princess Ichikishima.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.100
She absorbed the great aradama.

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:22.750
Just as I once did.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.030
Why?

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:28.620
It was likely Princess Ichikishima's will.

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:33.540
She wished to be absorbed by Juujou 
rather than Princess Tagitsu.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.300
And Juujou has gained the strength 
to repel Princess Tagitsu.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.830
Hiyori-chan? I'll ask 
about the details later,

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.400
but let's get back to the others.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:47.560
Stay back!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.400
Please, just stay back.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:55.400
Why?

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.880
For just a moment...

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:05.530
Kanami, I saw myself cutting you 
apart over and over and over again.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:11.540
It's future sight from the dragon's eye.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:16.240
Princess Ichikishima inside you 
can predict possible futures

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.550
and show them to you.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.130
Hiyori-chan, does it hurt?

00:01:23.630 --> 00:01:24.580
Hiyori-chan!

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:25.440
Don't go after her!

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:30.260
Etou, go back and report
 what's happened to Sana.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:33.410
Tell her to prepare for 
Princess Tagitsu's next attack.

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:35.200
But what about Hiyori-chan?

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:36.660
I'll go after her.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.730
You wouldn't be able to do anything,
 even if you did go after her.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:43.490
What Juujou needs right now 
is to control the aradama.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:47.160
I can teach her how to do that.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.410
Got it?

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:21.880
<b>Katana Maidens</b>

00:03:22.170 --> 00:03:27.590
<b>Episode 21  Sword of the Thunder God</b>

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.880
All of you should rest up a bit.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:32.150
I'm fine. Please, let me join 
the search for Hiyori-chan!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:36.140
No, you need to rest up 
and stay in top condition.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:38.750
Your abilities are indispensable to us.

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.740
Princess Tagitsu will be after Hiyori-chan

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.800
now that she's fused with 
Princess Ichikishima.

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.670
We have to protect her!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:45.900
Kanami-chan...

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:48.880
You don't think anyone but you can do it?

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.470
That's not what I meant...

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:52.950
This isn't like you, Kanamin.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:56.410
Let's just take a brief rest,
 so you can settle your feelings.

00:03:56.760 --> 00:04:00.340
Yeah, you have to recover 
before a boss battle.

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.670
Leave the hunt for Juujou to us.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:07.070
The bureau director has gone 
after her, too, hasn't she?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:08.890
Yes.

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.400
Director...

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.590
Both of you take a rest, too.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.240
The situation is what it is, and I 
will need to rely on you as well.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.940
Has Yomi still not been located?

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.320
There have been no reports at present.

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:31.820
I doubt even Yomi-san could 
have survived those wounds.

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:36.480
Satsuki Yomi has ingested 
an unusual number of aradama.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:38.330
I would like to save her if possible,

00:04:38.330 --> 00:04:41.840
but we must consider her under 
Princess Tagitsu's control.

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.460
No, we can't say that for sure.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:49.510
She seemed to have some kind
 of strong resolution of her own.

00:04:49.990 --> 00:04:52.130
Not something given from someone else.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:54.760
I don't believe it is 
anyone's will but Yomi-san's.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.510
Then why has she been fighting all this time?

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.230
I'm not sure.

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:00.770
Yomi...

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:08.570
So you were exhausted, after all.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:10.650
Mai...

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:14.570
I want to get stronger.

00:05:14.570 --> 00:05:15.420
Eh?

00:05:15.980 --> 00:05:18.320
I've always thought I was strong.

00:05:19.070 --> 00:05:22.080
And it was easy to complete 
the missions I was given.

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:26.060
But now I want to get stronger.

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:30.340
I want to get stronger and 
be of use to everyone.

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:33.310
Even more than Kanami and Hiyori.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:35.340
Sayaka-chan...

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:38.030
You've grown up a bit, too, Saaya.

00:05:39.030 --> 00:05:40.060
It's all right.

00:05:40.390 --> 00:05:43.980
You'll get even stronger now.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:48.370
Acting like she's the older sister...

00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:08.790
Origami Yukari...

00:06:09.290 --> 00:06:10.790
Does it hurt?

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:14.240
Ironic, isn't it?

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:17.470
You used to be the one 
possessed by an aradama,

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:19.820
and I was the one trying to kill you.

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:23.430
Now, I'm the aradama.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:28.940
Now that things are like this, Juujou, 
you must destroy Princess Tagitsu.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.190
That has always been my intent.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:35.320
Stop!

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:38.530
How many times did you slay me
through your future sight just now?

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:44.300
You probably cut me down in the end of 
various exchanges in every possible way.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:50.630
Though I don't think that would clear
 away the hatred you bear for me.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.630
Don't be swallowed by the aradama! 
Hold firmly to yourself!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.010
Listen, Juujou Hiyori.

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.990
You inherited the power 
of the Hiiragi family from Kagari.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:05.310
It is the exact same power that we,
 the Origami family, have.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:07.190
What are you talking about?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.760
The Origami suppress the aradama,

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.650
while it is your family,
 the Hiiragi, who exorcise them.

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:17.570
You could say that the Origami and Hiiragi 
are like two sides of the same coin.

00:07:18.550 --> 00:07:22.580
Even among the Toji, they are the families 
that are closest to special aradama.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:27.580
It is because of that power that you were 
able to fuse with Princess Ichikishima.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.290
Why?

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:34.170
If we're the same, then why was 
it only a Hiiragi, <i>my mother</i>,

00:07:34.170 --> 00:07:38.180
and not an Origami who had to sacrifice 
herself to suppress the aradama?!

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.800
It's absurd! I can't accept that!

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:42.680
And yet...

00:07:42.960 --> 00:07:47.220
Damn it! I can understand it 
through Princess Ichikishima.

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:52.690
You truly wanted to release my 
mother from such an absurd duty.

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:55.300
You sacrificed yourself to Princess Tagitsu

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:57.470
to save my mother and Kanami's.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:58.900
But!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.060
If no one is to blame,

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:08.500
then where do I direct my 
anger or my mother's regrets?

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:11.060
Destroy Princess Tagitsu.

00:08:11.060 --> 00:08:15.000
Take her down, absorb her into 
your body, and become an evil god.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:17.510
You want me to become an evil god?

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:22.260
Once you do that, I will 
bring an end to everything.

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:30.720
Owie...

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:33.360
Okay, that makes it my win, score 7 to 3.

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.450
You're so strong, master.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.120
You're pretty good yourself, though, Kanami.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.700
You got three points on me.

00:08:42.780 --> 00:08:45.440
So, what's bugging you this time?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.640
Hiyori-chan's fused with an aradama, huh?

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:55.090
Yeah. I was right there, 
but I couldn't stop her.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:58.960
Hiyori-chan has been a little 
weird since before the mission.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:03.840
I'm sure she thought she had to do something 
herself as things dragged on.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.100
Shidou-san even tried to warn me.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.930
Well, what's done is done.

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:12.850
It's not your fault.

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:15.930
You're so kind, Kanami.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.780
You're kind, and you care about your friends,

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.710
but you're cold and self-centered.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.010
Isn't that a contradiction?

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:29.040
It is, but the world of swordfighting 
is like that, right?

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.820
I want to get stronger because 
I work with the sword, too.

00:09:32.820 --> 00:09:33.790
I want to master it.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:37.470
But you defeat opponent after opponent,

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:41.330
and once you've beaten them all,
you find yourself all alone at the end.

00:09:41.820 --> 00:09:44.540
Even though you need an
 opponent to fight.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:48.210
Right now, you've gotten so strong

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.320
that there's no one over 
there to be your opponent.

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:52.210
That's why you always seem so lonely.

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:54.790
But that's okay.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.100
You're supposed to have 
those kinds of struggles.

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.350
An okatana is a dangerous thing to have.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.290
You just have to think about it like that.

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:07.410
What matters most is that you're kind, 
and you care about your friends.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.020
You are definitely a good kid.

00:10:10.020 --> 00:10:12.720
Your parents must've been amazing people.

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.050
That would be you.

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:17.980
I told you, that's not me.

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:21.340
If anything, it's the future me.

00:10:21.880 --> 00:10:25.220
Yeah, you were a very amazing mother.

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:28.100
Of course I was, because I'm me.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:31.950
You're just like my mom when you say that.

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:40.730
Okay!

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.090
We're definitely going to bring 
Hiyori-chan back with us.

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:49.950
Kanamin, your energy is back 
after just a bit of sleep.

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:52.560
Kanami-chan has always been like that.

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:55.060
She gets totally re-energized 
once she sleeps.

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:57.470
I'm feeling a bit better, somehow.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:00.850
Must be nice to be so simple.

00:11:02.910 --> 00:11:04.770
I'm so tired.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:06.430
Rui-san!

00:11:06.430 --> 00:11:07.860
Rui-rui!

00:11:07.860 --> 00:11:09.300
Did you desert?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:13.030
Don't say such outrageous things.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:15.920
I finally got released and 
was able to join up with you.

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.210
Huh? Where's Hiyori-chan?

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:21.820
We're going to get her back now.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:26.320
I haven't had a report back 
from the search unit yet.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:30.100
You all will form a unit 
and take up the search.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.330
Yanase is in command.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.260
Yes, ma'am.

00:11:32.260 --> 00:11:35.220
We can find Hiyoyon with a spectrum finder

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:38.080
or even Nene as she is now.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.960
Oh, in that case...

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.710
We're beta testing the latest version.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:46.210
We've expanded the measurement range.

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:48.220
The operation is still the same.

00:11:48.760 --> 00:11:53.000
I got along pretty well 
with Princess Ichikishima.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.970
I wanted to keep her safe as much as I could.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:59.430
Princess Ichikishima became 
one with Hiyori-chan

00:11:59.430 --> 00:12:01.810
to protect Yukari-sama.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:03.480
She hasn't completely disappeared.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.980
We will bring her back with Hiyori-chan.

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:08.990
Yes, please do.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:18.250
<i>So she's barely able to control it?</i>

00:12:25.150 --> 00:12:26.130
<i>She's here.</i>

00:12:27.690 --> 00:12:32.460
Now then, let's begin the final battle.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:35.140
No reaction.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:38.750
The shrine is that way, and if
 we cross the mountain...

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.370
Let's go further in.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:41.100
Okay.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:42.850
Nene?

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:49.840
You know, before, President Hashima said

00:12:49.840 --> 00:12:53.670
that seeing you and Hiyori-chan reminded her

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:56.330
of Minato-san and Kagari-san.

00:12:56.330 --> 00:13:00.790
My mom? I guess I don't 
really see it myself.

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.790
I wonder if Hiyori-chan 
looks like her mother, then.

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.750
I think she probably does.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:10.850
The president said that she was 
always by their side watching them.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:14.080
I think she was my mom's classmate...

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:15.930
A reaction!

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:18.550
It's big. It must be Hiyori-chan!

00:13:18.550 --> 00:13:19.390
Wait.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:23.940
They're fighting.

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:29.190
Beyond just being clad in lightning,

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:31.700
your speed and impact have 
increased remarkably.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:36.140
You have finally merged and raised 
your ability level greatly,

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:40.450
but you don't honestly think that 
you can defeat me like this, do you?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:44.210
All you've done is gained 
Princess Ichikishima's powers.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.100
While I, on the other hand,

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:49.710
gained considerable power when 
I absorbed Princess Takiri.

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.780
Don't be fooled, Juujou!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.970
You're even stronger than 
Princess Tagitsu now!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:55.720
Nonsense.

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.850
When two aradama combine,
it's just simple addition.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:02.550
She hasn't reached nearly the amount 
of noro she had half a year ago!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:06.350
You pathetic cast-off. Just keep 
yapping away all you want.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:09.670
The merging of a Toji and 
aradama together is a multiplier.

00:14:09.670 --> 00:14:12.290
It will cause some kind 
of scientific reaction.

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.700
Now to mention, Juujou,

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:17.120
that you have the special qualities 
you inherited from your mother!

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.740
Princess Tagitsu is afraid of you!

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.000
I am a god.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.880
An evil god.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.750
A god is immortal.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.750
Gods may be immortal as a concept,

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:33.630
but you are nothing more than 
an aradama imitating life.

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:36.800
Cut down the aradama and exorcise it, Juujou!

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.140
I see. You're quick.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:47.440
However, dealing with such power 
must take a toll on your body.

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:52.850
<i>The future sight of the dragon's eye...</i>

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:56.550
When they can both read each others' moves
 through it, each battle becomes a draw.

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.570
Put all of your power into your attacks!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.160
Why, you!

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:17.590
Kogarasumaru's blade is fatal.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:21.100
Yukari... damn you.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:26.270
I let you go as just some pathetic 
cast-off, but now you're an eyesore.

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:27.020
Die!

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:36.110
You can still use your utsushi?

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.800
Hiyori-chan!

00:15:51.170 --> 00:15:55.300
Splendid. That is the form of the 
coexistence between humans and aradama

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.740
that Princess Ichikishima imagined.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:00.450
You are the embodiment of it.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:09.840
What happened?

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:13.360
Juujou defeated Princess Tagitsu.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:17.860
And she has taken all of them into her body.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:21.930
Juujou has become an evil god.

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:30.160
What is this feeling?

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.790
Kanamin! Please be careful.

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:34.620
Kanami...

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:37.300
Hiyori-chan...

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.740
Can you hold on to yourself, Juujou?

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:43.150
This will be the end,
if you can suppress them.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:47.770
If you can't do it, then you will come 
with me to the depths of the netherworld.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.270
Yukari-sama...

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:51.110
That would work, too.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.350
Hiyori-chan.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:56.690
I see, so that's what you 
meant by ending everything.

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:58.830
We are the two sides of the same coin,

00:16:58.830 --> 00:17:01.360
and now our positions are completely 
flipped from before, aren't they?

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:04.160
So you're going to throw your life away

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.950
and try to plunge me into 
the netherworld this time?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:09.840
I won't have to, if you can 
manage to suppress it.

00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:13.120
I know full well how difficult that can be.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:16.490
I only managed to suppress 
it for twenty years,

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:20.140
but you, on the other hand...

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.880
Remain like this for twenty years?

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.640
That seems impossible for me.

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:28.820
Is that so?

00:17:28.820 --> 00:17:31.640
But I won't seek your help, either.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.310
I will...

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.430
Hiyori-chan!

00:17:34.430 --> 00:17:35.490
Hiyoyon...

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:38.380
Let's go back, Hiyori.

00:17:39.710 --> 00:17:43.660
Hey, I know I'm asking for
the impossible, but endure it.

00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:47.170
I might burst at any moment.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:52.410
If any of this overflowed outside,
a disaster like twenty years ago... no,

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.000
worse than that would happen.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:55.670
Hey.

00:17:57.420 --> 00:18:00.050
Are you strong now, Hiyori-chan?

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:01.920
Kanami-chan?

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:03.840
You are, aren't you?

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:07.430
I mean, you did defeat 
Princess Tagitsu, after all.

00:18:08.250 --> 00:18:11.680
Hey, would you be all right with us

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.190
continuing our match from the tournament?

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:15.760
Are you insane?

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.650
Kanamin, that's too much.

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.780
I guess my timing is pretty bad.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:24.660
But I was just thinking that this would be 
my only chance to face off with Hiyori-chan

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.380
when she's this strong.

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.000
Kanami...

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.540
Well, you're not going to 
be around anymore, right?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.770
Kanami!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:37.540
To tell the truth, I've gotten 
much stronger since then.

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:42.640
If I'd gone all out then, I would've 
beaten you single-handedly.

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:46.550
So now that I'm an evil god,
 we're finally equal?

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:49.300
I'm not sure about that.

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:52.860
Kanamin, that's enough!
You're really making me mad now!

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:55.270
Hiyoyon?

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.530
I'll get to see you at full strength, then?

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:00.700
Yeah, I'll use it all.

00:19:01.270 --> 00:19:04.780
W-Wait just a minute, now! You two are crazy!

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:09.530
She's always been like this, conversely kind.

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:11.990
Cold and self-centered?

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:13.290
Yeah.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:17.290
<i>Wait, was it Hiyori-chan who told me that?</i>

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:19.540
Don't go thinking that this is unfair.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:21.030
I won't.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:24.290
Your ability to use that 
is just part of your talent.

00:19:24.290 --> 00:19:26.670
It's just different from how I do things.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:30.100
<i>Impossible!</i>

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:33.930
<i>I lose completely when pitted against 
Kanami's sword at full strength.</i>

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:37.870
<i>Etou's sword accurately reads the 
three powers of heaven, earth, and humanity,</i>

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.080
<i>and instantly assembles a battle plan.</i>

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.930
<i>That part began to bloom 
that night in Kamakura,</i>

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:45.940
<i>and now we're seeing it 
at its full potential.</i>

00:19:46.440 --> 00:19:47.570
This is...

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:51.950
That is probably Etou's single sword.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:09.470
She cut...

00:20:09.470 --> 00:20:11.140
...the lightning in half!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.200
It can't be.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.480
Even with the power of an evil god...

00:20:20.480 --> 00:20:24.420
Oh? So you're going to just give up

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:27.900
and get sent to the depths of the 
netherworld with the aradama?

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:36.970
Kanami?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.250
I won't let you!

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.790
I absolutely won't let that happen!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:46.100
If you can't suppress it by yourself, 
then just let it all out!

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:50.180
I will cut it down for you. I will 
cut down every single last bit of it!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:54.110
I told you I would take on 
part of it, too, didn't I?

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.930
Please, just trust me a bit more.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:14.820
Hiyori?

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:20.090
You weren't the only one 
hatching a scheme, Yukari!

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.480
Hiyori-chan...?

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:39.890
<b>Next Episode  Gate of the Netherworld</b>
